# Publishing credential, by reference only.
#
# npm expands ${VAR} here from the environment, so the token itself lives in the
# repository-root .env (gitignored) and never in a tracked file. This file is
# committed on purpose: it carries no secret, and it is what makes
# `npm run release` use the Automation token instead of the interactive
# ~/.npmrc credential, which cannot satisfy a security-key 2FA prompt without a
# TTY.
#
# npm always excludes .npmrc from a published tarball, so this cannot ship.
//registry.npmjs.org/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}
